1
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:06,000
Sgt. Kellar: Lennox is dead. I killed him.

2
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:09,000
Sgt. Kellar: You know what he said to me the first time we met?

3
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:11,000
Sgt. Kellar: He said, “Don't trust them.”

4
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:14,000
Sgt. Kellar: I don't believe in coincidences either.

5
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:17,000
Interrogator: They were right about you, Kellar.

6
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:19,000
Interrogator: Right about what?

7
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:22,000
Interrogator: Your predictability. You did everything the psychologists said you'd do.

8
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:25,000
Sgt. Kellar: What the hell is going on here?

9
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:27,000
Interrogator: Lennox isn't dead. He's very much alive.

10
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:31,000
Interrogator: And thanks to the mess you created, we can hunt him down without Congress breathing down our necks.

11
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:34,000
Interrogator: You've untied our hands.

12
00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:36,000
Sgt. Kellar: What are you talking about?

13
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:39,000
Interrogator: You're right.

14
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:43,000
Interrogator: Nothing is a coincidence, Sergeant Kellar.

15
00:00:43,000 --> 00:00:46,000
Interrogator: I'm going to destroy William Lennox, and you're going to help me.

16
00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:49,000
Sgt. Kellar: What about the charges? My trial?

17
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:53,000
Interrogator: You'll die in a fiery crash on your way to the hearing.

18
00:00:53,000 --> 00:00:57,000
Interrogator: As far as anyone's concerned, this fiasco will end with your death.

19
00:00:56,000 --> 00:01:00,000
Interrogator: You made it through, Sergeant. You crossed the finish line.

20
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:06,000
Interrogator: A while back, you said you wanted to kill Lennox so bad you could taste it.

21
00:01:06,000 --> 00:01:10,000
Interrogator: Can you still taste it, Sergeant Kellar?

22
00:01:10,000 --> 00:01:12,000
Sgt. Kellar: Yes.

23
00:01:12,000 --> 00:01:16,000
Interrogator: Then let us begin.
